# What NOT to upload to Cloud Build. Without this, `gcloud run deploy --source`
# ships the 3 GB target/ directory on every deploy.
#
# gcloud will synthesise one of these from .gitignore when it is absent, but
# relying on that has cost people a lot of minutes. Be explicit.

.git/
.gitignore

# Rust build output — rebuilt inside the image anyway
target/

# Local-only
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.claude/
.delta/
node_modules/
.DS_Store

# Not needed to build or run the service
docs/
report/*.pdf
report/data.json
*.md
!README.md

# Submission docs; 5-implementation/ holds symlinks back to the code
1-solution/
2-architecture/
3-reporting/
4-testing/
5-implementation/
